      "writtenOn": "2024-06-20T15:16:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, maybe we should just ignore the recorder for non-Graphite images?\n\nThat\u0027s what `makeSubset`, `makeColorSpace` \u0026 friends seem to do, we should at least keep them consistent.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 213,
        "startChar": 0,
